  "system": {
    "biography": "<p><strong>Chauffeur and bodyguard both.</strong> He drives the Toyota Elite that brings Mr. Johnson to Pier 36, and he opens the door. Corporate to the bone: he does the job, no questions asked.</p><p><strong>He will not start anything.</strong> The adventure is explicit — he attacks only if the player characters become violent first. If they do, he and Juan Diablo lay down cover while Johnson gets to the car.</p><p><strong>Loadout per QE:</strong> a lined coat (4/2) and a <strong>Browning Max-Power with a silencer and explosive ammo</strong>. With Firearms 7 and Wired Reflexes on a Reaction 6, he is a considerably harder proposition than he looks standing by the car.</p>",
